---
description: Finding and Delta authority rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Build/Test failure creates a Finding first.
- Cursor may create/update delivery/findings/ within the active Task lifecycle.
- Cursor must not author, approve, close, or fabricate a DESIGN_DELTA decision.
- delivery/deltas/ is HUMAN_GOVERNANCE controlled.
- SPEC_AMBIGUITY, DESIGN_DELTA_CANDIDATE, or contract-affecting BUILD_BLOCKER requires affected Task BLOCKED.
- An implementation or test bug may use the Fast Loop only when contract semantics do not change.
- Same strategy may fail at most twice; third attempt is forbidden.
- Product/design change path is Finding → Human governance → Product Working → User approval → new Build Spec → Activation → rebind.
